    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Soulblaze!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your Bindshards, pet your Animons, and go on an adventure. This game is a creature collecting and dice rolling roguelite. Fight your way through several regions and beat their bosses, build your team as you go, find consumables, teach your creatures tricks, and become the strongest Animancer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.poster.avif?t=1755625193\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.webm?t=1755625193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.mp4?t=1755625193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/28687261e2cbaf0665c6f85a099303d1.avif?t=1755625193\" width=595 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >capture and train unique hand-drawn creatures that each have their own passive ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >combat hybrid between classic creature-collecting RPGs and TTRPG dice-roll mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade and customize techniques by combining tags to create your own individual builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s-retro + fantasy: flash drives, sticker albums, and magic, baby!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bite-Sized Creature Collecting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the fun of picking a starter and building your team without having to commit dozens of hours. Runs are fast-paced and always different, each of your teams unique every time. You won't run out of action points, you won't have to walk to the last healing provider over and over, you just keep going... until you win? Yes, win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, you collect marbles that you can spend on permanent upgrades that enhances your Animons, gives you more options during a run, unlocks starters and more. Who knows, maybe one day you can hatch special Animons this way, too?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/5510672964fcb18a5935774daa368233.avif?t=1755625193\" width=595 height=91 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/dc5a24a3a75ac2e4f5e968b1036a65fc.avif?t=1755625193\" width=708 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers interact with the game. They can suggest which path to take, spend channel points to give you rewards, predict enemy moves, and even bid on Animons to permanently adopt them across streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo-Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulblaze is being created by a single person who grew up loving creature collecting games. This is a passion project of combining their joy of cute little critters, roguelites, and dice-rolling into one package.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Soulblaze!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your Bindshards, pet your Animons, and go on an adventure. This game is a creature collecting and dice rolling roguelite. Fight your way through several regions and beat their bosses, build your team as you go, find consumables, teach your creatures tricks, and become the strongest Animancer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.poster.avif?t=1755625193\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.webm?t=1755625193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/19a7d12dad3bd919abe3c139d58177d6.mp4?t=1755625193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/28687261e2cbaf0665c6f85a099303d1.avif?t=1755625193\" width=595 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >capture and train unique hand-drawn creatures that each have their own passive ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >combat hybrid between classic creature-collecting RPGs and TTRPG dice-roll mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade and customize techniques by combining tags to create your own individual builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s-retro + fantasy: flash drives, sticker albums, and magic, baby!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bite-Sized Creature Collecting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the fun of picking a starter and building your team without having to commit dozens of hours. Runs are fast-paced and always different, each of your teams unique every time. You won't run out of action points, you won't have to walk to the last healing provider over and over, you just keep going... until you win? Yes, win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, you collect marbles that you can spend on permanent upgrades that enhances your Animons, gives you more options during a run, unlocks starters and more. Who knows, maybe one day you can hatch special Animons this way, too?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/5510672964fcb18a5935774daa368233.avif?t=1755625193\" width=595 height=91 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505230/extras/dc5a24a3a75ac2e4f5e968b1036a65fc.avif?t=1755625193\" width=708 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers interact with the game. They can suggest which path to take, spend channel points to give you rewards, predict enemy moves, and even bid on Animons to permanently adopt them across streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo-Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulblaze is being created by a single person who grew up loving creature collecting games. This is a passion project of combining their joy of cute little critters, roguelites, and dice-rolling into one package.</p>",
    "short_description": "Catch Animons and roll some dice in this cute creature-collecting roguelite! Build your team, train them well, and fight your way through several regions. Can you defeat all bosses?",
